Article 8 (Notification of Evaluation Results, etc.) The leader of an evaluation team may notify the head of the relevant emergency rescue support agency of the following matters identified as a result of an evaluation: <Amended on July 9, 2026>
1. Status of emergency rescue support personnel of emergency rescue support agencies who responded excellently to disasters;
2. Status of emergency rescue support personnel of emergency rescue support agencies who failed to respond to disasters or responded inappropriately.
